# Which source of electricity is the deadliest?
subtitle: "Rank coal, oil, gas, nuclear and solar by deaths per unit of electricity, then see what a town would pay for each in lives."
tags: ["health","earth","data"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"Rank your fears\" stamp \"Nuclear?\""

## Which source of electricity is the deadliest?
use: bar_chart
with:
    labels:
      - Solar
      - Nuclear
      - Gas
      - Oil
      - Coal
    values:
      - 0.02
      - 0.03
      - 2.8
      - 18.4
      - 24.6
    value_labels: true
    bar_colors: same
    y_label: Deaths per TWh
    label_size: 32
    ylim:
      - 0
      - 38
    icons:
      - {of: sun, set: twemoji}
      - {of: radioactive, set: twemoji}
      - {of: fire, set: twemoji}
      - {of: oil drum, set: twemoji}
      - {of: factory, set: twemoji}
sources:
    - id: safest
      title: What are the safest and cleanest sources of energy?
      authors: Hannah Ritchie (Our World in Data)
      year: 2020
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/safest-sources-of-energy
      finding: 'deaths from accidents and air pollution per TWh of electricity: coal 24.6, oil 18.4, gas 2.8, nuclear 0.03, solar 0.02; a European town of 150,000 using 1 TWh a year would see 25 early deaths a year on coal and one death every 33 years on nuclear; nuclear includes Chernobyl and Fukushima; wind 0.04'
    - id: data
      title: Death rates per unit of electricity production
      authors: Our World in Data, from Markandya & Wilkinson (2007), Sovacool et al. (2016) and UNSCEAR
      year: 2021
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/death-rates-from-energy-production-per-twh
      finding: the chart's numbers

    cards rank size 2 ends ["most","least"] hidden true
        * "Coal" icon.of factory icon.set twemoji
        * "Oil" icon.of "oil drum" icon.set twemoji
        * "Gas" icon.of fire icon.set twemoji
        * "Nuclear" icon.of radioactive icon.set twemoji
        * "Solar" icon.of sun icon.set twemoji
    text incl "incl. Chernobyl, Fukushima" #2f6b8f cites ["safest"] x 360 y 470 font_size 38 hidden true
    arrow incl_ar #2f6b8f from.x 386 from.y 440 to.x 386 to.y 285 hidden true
    path div dashed #8f887c points [[500,660],[500,190]] style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    icon c_icon size 130 set twemoji x 140 y 610 icon_look picture of factory hidden true
    icon c_town size 150 set twemoji x 340 y 610 icon_look picture of houses hidden true
    text c_l "coal: 25 a year" #b5482e cites ["safest"] x 250 y 185 font_size 52 hidden true
    icon n_icon size 130 set twemoji x 640 y 610 icon_look picture of radioactive hidden true
    icon n_town size 150 set twemoji x 840 y 610 icon_look picture of houses hidden true
    icon n_p size 70 set twemoji x 740 y 410 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    text n_l "nuclear: 1 per 33 yrs" #2f6b8f cites ["safest"] x 750 y 250 font_size 44 hidden true
    text wind "wind: about the same" #5e584e cites ["safest"] x 750 y 190 font_size 36 hidden true
    icon cp00 size 56 set twemoji x 130 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp01 size 56 set twemoji x 192 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp02 size 56 set twemoji x 254 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp03 size 56 set twemoji x 316 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp04 size 56 set twemoji x 378 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp10 size 56 set twemoji x 130 y 420 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp11 size 56 set twemoji x 192 y 420 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp12 size 56 set twemoji x 254 y 420 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp13 size 56 set twemoji x 316 y 420 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp14 size 56 set twemoji x 378 y 420 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp20 size 56 set twemoji x 130 y 370 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp21 size 56 set twemoji x 192 y 370 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp22 size 56 set twemoji x 254 y 370 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp23 size 56 set twemoji x 316 y 370 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp24 size 56 set twemoji x 378 y 370 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp30 size 56 set twemoji x 130 y 320 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp31 size 56 set twemoji x 192 y 320 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp32 size 56 set twemoji x 254 y 320 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp33 size 56 set twemoji x 316 y 320 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp34 size 56 set twemoji x 378 y 320 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp40 size 56 set twemoji x 130 y 270 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp41 size 56 set twemoji x 192 y 270 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp42 size 56 set twemoji x 254 y 270 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp43 size 56 set twemoji x 316 y 270 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon cp44 size 56 set twemoji x 378 y 270 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    group crowd members ["cp00","cp01","cp02","cp03","cp04","cp10","cp11","cp12","cp13","cp14","cp20","cp21","cp22","cp23","cp24","cp30","cp31","cp32","cp33","cp34","cp40","cp41","cp42","cp43","cp44"] hidden true

    card title "Which energy kills the most?"

A: Same amount of electricity from each. Which source kills the most people, counting accidents and air pollution?
    draw rank

B: Easy. Nuclear. Chernobyl, Fukushima, glowing fish.
    highlight rank_4

    ask "Order them: fewest deaths on the left, most on the right. Then press Done." on rank store r
        right: You got {r}. Coal is the deadliest, and nuclear sits down beside solar.
        wrong: You got {r}. Think about what comes out of the chimney.

    erase rank

A: Deaths per terawatt-hour, about a year of power for a town of a hundred and fifty thousand. Coal, about twenty-five. Oil, about eighteen.
    draw axes bar_5 bar_4

B: Mine collapses? Oil rig fires?
    highlight bar_5 bar_4

A: Mostly not. Mostly smoke in people's lungs. Gas burns cleaner: about three.
    draw bar_3

B: Now nuclear. Brace yourself.
    draw bar_1 bar_2

A: Three hundredths, right beside solar at two. And that already counts Chernobyl and Fukushima.
    draw incl incl_ar

B: Including Chernobyl? I demand a recount.
    highlight bar_2

    erase axes bar_1 bar_2 bar_3 bar_4 bar_5 incl incl_ar

A: Back to that town. Run it on coal, and about twenty-five people die early, every year.
    draw div c_icon c_town crowd c_l

A: Run it on nuclear, and you would expect one death every thirty-three years. Wind is about the same.
    draw n_icon n_town n_p n_l wind

B: So I've been scared of the wrong chimney.
    highlight c_l

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon a size 240 set twemoji x 200 y 480 icon_look picture of radioactive hidden true
    icon b size 240 set twemoji x 470 y 480 icon_look picture of factory hidden true
    icon c size 240 set twemoji x 740 y 480 icon_look picture of sun hidden true
    text q "Which kills more?" #b5482e x 470 y 300 font_size 80 hidden true
    thumb band "Rank your fears" kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon chim size 300 set twemoji x 260 y 470 icon_look picture of factory hidden true
    icon sm size 170 set twemoji x 330 y 640 icon_look picture of cloud hidden true
    text t "? deaths" #b5482e x 680 y 540 font_size 130 hidden true
    text t2 "per town, per year" #2f2b26 x 680 y 390 font_size 64 hidden true
    thumb band "One town. Five power plants." kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    shape l #b5482e shape rect x 250 y 470 width 340 height 340 style.fill #e9c4b8 hidden true
    shape r #2f6b8f shape rect x 700 y 470 width 340 height 340 style.fill #cfe3ee hidden true
    icon ln size 200 set twemoji x 250 y 490 icon_look picture of radioactive hidden true
    icon rn size 200 set twemoji x 700 y 490 icon_look picture of sun hidden true
    text vs "=?" #2f2b26 x 475 y 470 font_size 110 hidden true
    thumb band "Which is deadlier?" kind band hidden true
